// SAMPLE STORY, NOT GAME CONTENT. It shows the app's story host (frontend/mobile/src/game/story/) and the
// tags writers use (README.md in this folder). The real prologue and weeks are Zahid's to write.
// Compile after editing: in frontend/mobile, run `pnpm ink`.

=== prologue ===
#speaker:Hudhud
Hello! I am Hudhud. I carry letters.
#speaker:Hudhud
This one is from you, five years from now. Most of it is smudged.
Let's see what kind of week you like.

* [Open the letter now]
    You open it. Only one line is clear: "Try things. Notice what you enjoy."
* [Keep it for later]
    You put it in your bag. It feels warm, somehow.
-
#speaker:Hudhud
It's Saturday. Your cousin and your best friend both need you.
Which would you rather do? #item:story_prologue_saturday
* [Fix the radio at home #type:R]
    You open the back of the radio. Two wires are loose. Click. Music!
* [Help a friend study #type:S]
    You explain fractions with slices of roti. Your friend laughs and gets it.
-
#speaker:Hudhud
Now the school fair is coming.
What would you rather do for it? #item:story_prologue_fair
* [Design the poster #type:A]
    You draw a bright poster. People stop to look.
* [Keep the stall's accounts #type:C]
    You count the money twice. Every rupee is right.
-
#speaker:Hudhud
Well done. There are no right or wrong answers here. Each week, the letter gets a little clearer.
-> DONE
